 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Extension of an embedding into a separably closed field",
 "statement": "Let F, E and K be fields, let L be an intermediate field of E/F [def-pc-field-extension], let f:L\\to K be an F-algebra homomorphism, assume every element of E is integral over F and every minimal polynomial over F of an element of E splits after applying F\\to K. Then there exists an F-algebra homomorphism \\phi:E\\to K whose restriction to L is f.",
